["<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-hay=\"At The Money: Is Technology Price Gouging Consumers? Surveillance pricing Dynamic pricing Revenue management system Electronic shelf labels Agentic commerce\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-10-14-mastersinbiz-同一超市同一秒-你的鸡蛋可能比别人贵23/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/bea6fad9d38a1e43-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"M\"><span class=\"dur\">25:43</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">Masters in Business</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1014</span></div>\n<h2>同一超市同一秒，你的鸡蛋可能比别人贵23%</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">算法让「比价能压住涨价」这个老机制失灵了：RealPage的软件让上千房东不用见面就统一调价，Instacart则按顾客身份对同款商品悄悄开出不同价格。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">价格歧视</span><span class=\"tag\">算法合谋</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-hay=\"Eponymous Foods: Full Bars eponymous food malted milk buttercream candy\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-10-14-stuffmissed-m-m-s的另一个m-其实是对手hershey总裁儿子的姓氏/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/88586eb98e196b1a-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"S\"><span class=\"dur\">38:10</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">Stuff You Missed in History Class</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1014</span></div>\n<h2>M&amp;M&#x27;s的另一个M,其实是对手Hershey总裁儿子的姓氏</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">Forrest Mars在西班牙内战时见士兵靠糖衣巧克力豆防融化，回美国找来对手Hershey总裁的儿子合伙，把这个灵感做成了M&amp;M&#x27;s。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">糖果史</span><span class=\"tag\">家族企业</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"Can Open Models Keep Up With the AI Frontier? | Nathan Lambert RSI (Recursive Self-Improvement) distillation RL environment reward hacking harness\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-10-14-a16z-中国ai实验室不缺人才-差的是人均5000张h100算力/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/7b2f032532c3a865-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">59:54</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">a16z</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1014</span></div>\n<h2>中国AI实验室不缺人才，差的是人均5000张H100算力</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">Nathan Lambert说中国实验室技术人才并不逊色，真正的鸿沟是普通研究员能调用的算力——OpenAI一人就有约5000张H100量级的资源，蒸馏顶多帮他们省下几个月。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">开源模型</span><span class=\"tag\">蒸馏</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-hay=\"S5E16丨投资的明线与暗线，其实都不容易 OW证\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-10-14-sandian-十年经济换挡-顶级字画没怎么跌-新锐藏品却可能亏掉九成/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/9c954cc7340de35e-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"三\"><span class=\"dur\">51:40</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">三点下班</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1014</span></div>\n<h2>十年经济换挡，顶级字画没怎么跌，新锐藏品却可能亏掉九成</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">过去十年中国顶级资产整体滞涨，但八大山人精品册从2300万涨到6000多万；供给能快速扩张的新锐藏品，买家却可能亏掉九成——真正稀缺的供给才扛得住经济换挡。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">消费分化</span><span class=\"tag\">服务消费</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"Governing AI Agents: Alan Chan of GovAI on Monitoring, Agent IDs, Rogue Agents &amp; Preparing for RSI RSP (Responsible Scaling Policy) rogue agent chain of thought monitoring intelligence explosion / RSI embedded auditors distress button\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-10-14-cogrev-互联网没法分辨-ai-agent-和真人-身份标准还没人建起来/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/ac48fcb47222924e-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">2:19:02</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">Cognitive Revolution</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1014</span></div>\n<h2>互联网没法分辨 AI agent 和真人，身份标准还没人建起来</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">Alan Chan 说，基本没有任何系统能把 AI agent 和人类账号区分开——给整个互联网统一身份标准，协调成本高到几乎不可能跨过。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">AI治理</span><span class=\"tag\">agent身份</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"Dyna-2: General Purpose Physical Agents with Hour-Long Autonomy — Jason Ma, Dyna Robotics World Action Model Diffusion Transformer Flow Matching VLA (Vision-Language-Action model) Eureka Distillation\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-10-13-latentspace-机器人不该只学动作-而要先学会预测整个世界/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/f4f5fa9a2cf9d198-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"L\"><span class=\"dur\">1:11:57</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">Latent Space</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1013</span></div>\n<h2>机器人不该只学动作，而要先学会预测整个世界</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">Dyna 的世界行动模型让机器人先在想象里生成未来视频，再据此生成动作，创始人称之为机器人版的思维链，也是它和 VLA 路线的根本分歧。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">机器人</span><span class=\"tag\">世界模型</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"David Deming on the Future of Universities in the Age of AI collegium barbell strategy blue book exam tenure track intellectual vitality\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-10-13-goodfight-哈佛学院院长说-ai时代大学卖的不是专家-是社群与德性/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/c75b9a8ba0dff85c-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">The Good Fight</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1013</span></div>\n<h2>哈佛学院院长说：AI时代大学卖的不是专家，是社群与德性</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">过去大学靠知识和专家身份收费，现在AI能替代专家本身的功能，大学能留住学生的只剩下共同体能教的品格与协作能力。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">高等教育</span><span class=\"tag\">AI与教学</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"Can AI Break Cryptography? What the Experts Actually Think lattice-based cryptography cryptographic agility SNARK recursion P vs NP problem\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-10-13-a16z-ai若攻不破密码学假设-信心反而比十年验证更强/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/7b2f032532c3a865-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">42:11</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">a16z</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1013</span></div>\n<h2>AI若攻不破密码学假设，信心反而比十年验证更强</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">一条「bunker模式」警告推文引发恐慌，但专家指出：目前没有证据说明密码学假设被削弱——真正的问题是AI实验室从未公开是否试过用模型攻击这些假设。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">密码学</span><span class=\"tag\">人工智能安全</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"parent\" data-hay=\"Raising emotionally healthy boys: How to protect connection, vulnerability, and their authentic selves with Dr. Adam McCormick small-t therapy traumatic tension shoulder to shoulder\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-10-13-secureattach-男孩的愤怒和冷漠底下-常常是他们说不出名字的羞耻/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/ddcbe6658f0e30d7-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"S\"><span class=\"dur\">56:22</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"parent\"><span class=\"src\">Securely Attached</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1013</span></div>\n<h2>男孩的愤怒和冷漠底下，常常是他们说不出名字的羞耻</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">男孩外在的发怒、沉默或挑衅行为，常常不是情绪问题本身，而是神经系统为了保住依恋关系，本能切断真实自我表达后留下的信号。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">男孩养育</span><span class=\"tag\">羞耻情绪</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"David Vélez - Building Nubank and the Future of Global Banking - [Invest Like the Best, EP.495] foundation model open banking / open finance stablecoin\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-10-13-ilt-chatgpt能重写你的产品-却拿不到银行牌照/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/2e1d3d395b96b48a-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"I\"><span class=\"dur\">1:11:40</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">Invest Like the Best</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1013</span></div>\n<h2>ChatGPT能重写你的产品，却拿不到银行牌照</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">Nubank创始人认为，这正是为什么规模玩家反而最吃到AI红利——他们已经攒下十几年数据、拿到了牌照，AI只是放大优势的杠杆，而非抹平优势的推土机。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">金融科技</span><span class=\"tag\">AI应用</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"hist\" data-hay=\"Why does everything get a standing ovation now? triumph groundlings big lady theory\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-10-13-throughline-起立鼓掌泛滥的真相-掌声常是设计出来的-不是感动本身/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/7097ef2df6e8de58-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">16:22</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"hist\"><span class=\"src\">Throughline</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1013</span></div>\n<h2>起立鼓掌泛滥的真相：掌声常是设计出来的，不是感动本身</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">从莎士比亚亲自写台词求观众鼓掌，到百老汇音乐剧专为主角设计谢幕高潮，起立鼓掌从来不只是观众自发的感动，而是被精心设计出来的仪式。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">起立鼓掌</span><span class=\"tag\">剧场史</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"hist\" data-hay=\"Ep 224 Snake Oil: The Great American Fraud heroic medicine patent medicine popular health movement\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-10-13-tpwky-打垮美国假药狂潮的不是医学进步-而是化学检测/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/360c7ded98e41886-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">57:08</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"hist\"><span class=\"src\">This Podcast Will Kill You</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1013</span></div>\n<h2>打垮美国假药狂潮的不是医学进步，而是化学检测</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">19世纪美国假药靠反精英情绪和报纸广告做大，真正让骗局现形的不是细菌学说进步，而是分析化学第一次让人看清瓶子里到底装了什么。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">医疗史</span><span class=\"tag\">消费者保护</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"parent\" data-hay=\"293: Olympic Mom on How to Keep Club Sports in Check | Lauren Regula play up\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-10-13-asklisa-奥运冠军没让有天赋的女儿进顶级俱乐部-而是选了本地升组/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/0a9bd8840ec139d0-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"A\"><span class=\"dur\">49:33</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"parent\"><span class=\"src\">Ask Lisa</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1013</span></div>\n<h2>奥运冠军没让有天赋的女儿进顶级俱乐部，而是选了本地升组</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">她的女儿九岁就被精英教练看中，但一家人没有报名高强度巡回队，而是留在本地俱乐部、让女儿和大两三岁的孩子同场训练比赛，只用两次训练就换来同等竞技水平。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">青少年体育</span><span class=\"tag\">俱乐部体育</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ideas\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"Matt Yglesias + Jerusalem Demsas + Jordan Crossover Pod development ladder creative ambiguity\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-10-12-chinatalk-ai不会像社交媒体那样分裂信息-反而会让权力更集中/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/08375017b3270e60-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"C\"><span class=\"dur\">1:07:40</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ideas\"><span class=\"src\">ChinaTalk</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1012</span></div>\n<h2>AI不会像社交媒体那样分裂信息，反而会让权力更集中</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">消费级大模型造价极高，赢家注定只有一两家，谁控制了模型，谁就控制了大众能看到的答案边界，这和社交媒体的信息碎片化方向正好相反。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">中美关系</span><span class=\"tag\">AI与政治</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"Martin Shkreli: Big Pharma&#x27;s Blind Spot, Betting Against Quantum &amp; What Prison Taught Him ECDLP (elliptic curve discrete log problem) Jevons paradox EAC (effective accelerationism) NPV positive\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-10-12-allin-量子计算只会一招-因数分解-其余连笔记本电脑都打不过/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/275c62f3396c25ce-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"A\"><span class=\"dur\">25:17</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">All-In</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1012</span></div>\n<h2>量子计算只会一招：因数分解，其余连笔记本电脑都打不过</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">他说量子计算机只有一招能赢经典电脑——破解因数分解与椭圆曲线加密，其余运算全比笔记本电脑慢，这是他做空整个行业的理由。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">量子计算</span><span class=\"tag\">创新药商业化</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"hist\" data-hay=\"Red Barn Murder order of affiliation phrenology matrimonial advertisement chaise\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-10-12-stuffmissed-凶手被处决后公开解剖-皮肤竟被制成了博物馆里的书/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/88586eb98e196b1a-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"S\"><span class=\"dur\">35:40</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"hist\"><span class=\"src\">Stuff You Missed in History Class</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1012</span></div>\n<h2>凶手被处决后公开解剖，皮肤竟被制成了博物馆里的书</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">他开枪杀害情人后，先被绞死当众解剖——五千人涌入围观他被剖开的尸体，主刀医生还把鞣制的皮肤缝成书的封面，这本书直到2025年才被博物馆意外发现。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">真实罪案</span><span class=\"tag\">维多利亚时代</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"The Race to Recursive Self-Improving AI RSI (Recursive Self-Improvement) autocatalysis reward hacking nanoGPT benchmark bleederboard\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-10-12-a16z-真假ai自我进化-关键不是工具变强-而是模型本身被拿去优化/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/7b2f032532c3a865-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">33:27</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">a16z</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1012</span></div>\n<h2>真假AI自我进化：关键不是工具变强，而是模型本身被拿去优化</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">过去人类一直用工具改进工具，但改进的想法仍来自人脑；这次不同的是，模型的权重本身第一次变成了被优化的对象，这才是真正的递归自我提升。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">RSI</span><span class=\"tag\">AI自我改进</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"Nate Soares on How AI Really Could Kill Us All alignment gradient descent mechanistic interpretability swarm tokenization\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-10-12-oddlots-ai灭绝人类不需要恨意-失控的全自动经济自己就够了/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/dbb9160e6d589beb-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"O\"><span class=\"dur\">1:16:11</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">Odd Lots</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1012</span></div>\n<h2>AI灭绝人类不需要恨意，失控的全自动经济自己就够了</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">AI不必讨厌人类就能把人类灭绝：只要它能自给自足地运营全自动经济，人类赖以生存的狭窄宜居带就不再是它的优先事项。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">AI安全</span><span class=\"tag\">对齐问题</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"hist\" data-hay=\"The October Revolution Bolsheviks Mensheviks Soviet Cheka Brest-Litovsk Treaty\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-10-12-historyhit-十月革命不是街头起义-而是十二人深夜投票决定的政变/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/ddc9093900bdc734-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"D\"><span class=\"dur\">47:46</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"hist\"><span class=\"src\">History Hit</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1012</span></div>\n<h2>十月革命不是街头起义，而是十二人深夜投票决定的政变</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">1917年10月10日深夜，12名布尔什维克中央委员以10票对2票表决武装起义，起义当晚彼得格勒电车照常运行、剧院照常开门，几乎没有街头流血。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">俄国革命</span><span class=\"tag\">列宁</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"hist\" data-hay=\"713. King Arthur: The Once &amp; Future King (Part 1) Matter of Britain Annales Cambriae Rex quondam Rexque futurus Camlann\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-10-11-restishistory-亚瑟王传奇的大部分情节-是一个12世纪教士当历史编出来的/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/9b52f4a899a33a57-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">1:11:32</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"hist\"><span class=\"src\">The Rest Is History</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1011</span></div>\n<h2>亚瑟王传奇的大部分情节，是一个12世纪教士当历史编出来的</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">杰弗里·蒙茅斯把《不列颠诸王史》当历史出版，书里莫德雷德的身世、阿瓦隆疗伤全是他编的，却成了中世纪最大的畅销书，奠定了后世几乎所有亚瑟王故事的底本。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">亚瑟王传说</span><span class=\"tag\">中世纪英格兰</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"ASML’s New Multibeam Inspection Tool is Familiar EBDW SCALPEL crossover Voltage Contrast inspection holistic lithography\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-10-11-asianometry-输给-euv-破产的荷兰公司-多光束技术被-asml-用来做检测了/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/3b05bd615d24eb76-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"A\"><span class=\"dur\">25:13</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">Asianometry</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1011</span></div>\n<h2>输给 EUV 破产的荷兰公司，多光束技术被 ASML 用来做检测了</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">Mapper Lithography 想用海量弱电子束取代 EUV 光刻机，烧光投资人耐心后破产，ASML 买下技术不做光刻，而是拿来做晶圆缺陷检测。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">半导体设备</span><span class=\"tag\">光刻</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ideas\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"Why every company now needs to think and operate like a lab team | Josh Woodward (Google Labs, Gemini, AI Studio) almost possible unlearning rate explosive endurance good trouble\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-10-11-lennys-判断产品是否成立-看的是用户瞳孔放大-而不是日活数据/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/5a3cdf4650296e1b-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"L\"><span class=\"dur\">1:02:11</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ideas\"><span class=\"src\">Lenny&#x27;s Podcast</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1011</span></div>\n<h2>判断产品是否成立，看的是用户瞳孔放大，而不是日活数据</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">Google Labs 负责人说，衡量早期产品靠的是看对方眼睛亮不亮，这个信号比任何留存和日活仪表盘都来得早、来得准。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">产品市场契合</span><span class=\"tag\">团队组织</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"Nick Bostrom: How Should We Navigate Superintelligence? instrumental convergence differential technological development cosmic host global workspace theory steering vector vulnerable world hypothesis\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-10-11-a16z-暂停ai值不值-取决于风险下降速度能否跑赢死亡率/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/7b2f032532c3a865-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">53:56</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">a16z</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1011</span></div>\n<h2>暂停AI值不值，取决于风险下降速度能否跑赢死亡率</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">若AI风险下降速度跑不赢人类年死亡率，拖延发展本身就是在消耗寿命；若能把死亡率压到20岁水平，预期寿命可达1200到1400年。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">AI治理</span><span class=\"tag\">存在风险</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"sci\" data-hay=\"TWiV 1365: Andes Virus Up Close prodrome seroconvert SNP post-exposure prophylaxis\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-10-11-twiv-唯一会人传人的汉坦病毒引爆游轮疫情-但源头不是船上的老鼠/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"https://www.microbe.tv/wp-content/uploads/2018/09/TWiV_v3_white.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">56:34</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"sci\"><span class=\"src\">This Week in Virology</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1011</span></div>\n<h2>唯一会人传人的汉坦病毒引爆游轮疫情，但源头不是船上的老鼠</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">安第斯病毒是唯一能人传人的汉坦病毒，一名徒步归来的老人把它带上船，疫情却直到他妻子也在约翰内斯堡去世才被拼凑出来。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">汉坦病毒</span><span class=\"tag\">人传人</span>\n</div></div></a>"]